{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Isolate linkage failures during factory creation.** This misses `LinkageError`. An older dynamic provider can raise `AbstractMethodError`, while missing optional classes can raise `NoClassDefFoundError`; either escapes invocation startup and fails user execution despite factory failures being documented as non-disruptive. Catch `LinkageError` and add regression coverage.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7wrPWK","finding_digest":"8b3308fc04cade5db1cda93bb2e31b48c346ae30229efb1261920fcc18d13a6f","finding_id":"arf_v1_rmzqr7aezlpf3monve53fyy3jd","finding_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/pluginrunner.java::createplugins::linkage-error-isolation","identity_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/pluginrunner.java::createplugins::linkage-error-isolation","line":69,"observation_digest":"d3fd8e1327aa21946d9a6f17bed14f3a03cc34f17a5c305c945d477b82e92f89","observation_id":"aro_v1_2p6y4ezhviqzi3m2n4l35ukphi","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-17T14:16:50Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ngxfyv63p4lqudenuthqx2ntut","reviewed_base_sha":"adb57764dd7b0d927e52f756ecb9bca4eb0f5a91","reviewed_head_sha":"6cca5434eabe54d85f0c08613b2938245c70d29e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":69,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_s7ab6zexlbj6ndyrbmfzh4elr7"},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_a4km53u2rxjxy3fwevrsuxduct","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-17T14:16:50Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
